58	// ================================================================
59	// Intra-register CAS helpers
60	//
61	// For v = [a, b, c, d]:
62	//   Reverse2(d4, v)               → [b, a, d, c]  (swap adjacent pairs)
63	//   CombineShiftRightBytes<8>(d4,v,v) → [c, d, a, b]  (rotate by 2 elements)
64	//
65	//   OddEven(odd_src, even_src): even-indexed lanes ← even_src,
66	//                               odd-indexed  lanes ← odd_src
67	//
68	// All helpers are provably branchless: Min/Max/OddEven/Combine each
69	// compile to two or three SIMD instructions on any supported target.
